  "notes": "{責|せ}める means to blame, criticize, or torment someone.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ particle: ⟦{彼|かれ}→彼：01292_kare⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{責|せ}める\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{自分|じぶん}→自分：02887_jibun⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{責|せ}める: to blame oneself\n- {責|せ}めないで: don't blame (me/them)\n- {責|せ}められる: to be blamed (passive)\n\nUSAGE:\n1. Blame/criticize: Finding fault with someone\n2. Torment: Causing mental or physical distress\n\nHOMOPHONE DISTINCTION:\n- {責|せ}める: to blame, torment (責 = responsibility)\n- ⟦{攻|せ}める→攻める：02123_semeru⟧: to attack (攻 = attack) - military/sports context\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{責任|せきにん}→責任：03298_sekinin⟧: responsibility\n- ⟦{非難|ひなん}→非難：14616_hinan⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to criticize (more formal)",
